			"notes": "## Supported Versions\n- 1.21.1\n## Change Log\n- Chinese (Simplified) localization support (merged community contribution)\n- While sneaking and breaking a double slab, the hitbox now dynamically shrinks to match each half in real time\n- Improved face-culling to prevent hidden faces from being rendered\n- Same-type glass slab textures now connect seamlessly\n- Performance optimizations throughout rendering and model loading\n- Added bedrock slab\n- Fixed some minor bugs"
		},
